<title>JAPAN: Daido Steel Sheet - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Daido Steel Sheet - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 22.62		vs	   22.40</p>
<p> Operating	  570 million	 vs	  405 million</p>
<p> Current	    325 million	 vs	    5 million</p>
<p> Net		  110 million	 vs	   43 million</p>
<p> EPS		    1.84 yen	  vs	    0.81 yen</p>
<p> Shares		60 million	 vs	   59 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Daido Steel Sheet Corp makes galvanised steel sheets and is affiliated with Nippon Steel Corp.</p>
